grilling is a local interaction overlay adapted from https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
at revision 8b36d4fb2635b3c21998dcd8144439c9e5ba7302 (release v1.2.2), path
skills/productivity/grilling. The unmodified upstream SKILL.md is preserved as
references/upstream.md. The overlay adds native question-tool presentation,
question-capable mode negotiation, bounded frontier batches, and continuation
across user replies.

